  <text>
    <body>
      <p>Robert Bodington, millwright and engineer, is listed in <ref target="civic?id=Queensberry%20Street">Queensberry Street</ref> in the Sands &amp; McDougall directories from 1860 to 1930, a run of seventy years. He is at No. 6 from 1860 to 1862 and No. 4 from 1863 to 1885, and after the street was renumbered at No. 241 from 1900 to 1930. From 1910 he is listed as a milling engineer.</p>
      <p>The directories also list a Robert Bodington in Barry Street from 1869. Those listings give no trade and are not linked to this entry.</p>
      <p><hi rend="italic">This entry is a machine-assisted first draft by Common Ground, written from the directory records. Please correct or add to it.</hi></p>
    </body>
